     "explanation": "The physiological sigh: double-inhale through the nose, then long exhale through the mouth. The second inhale re-inflates collapsed alveoli; the long exhale offloads CO2 and stimulates vagal activity. Five minutes daily for 28 days outperformed mindfulness on mood and anxiety in the trial.",
