" fill=\"#ffffff\">- Pre-presentation</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"960\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">- During a frustrating conversation</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"995\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\">- Lying awake at 3am unable to sleep</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"1025\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffd700\">Replaces no other tool — just adds one cheap one</text></svg>",
